{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1169,
  "batch_count": 1655,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "9c226cba1af606e532633417d9bfcf7f7d66a4bf",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b1ca0c170bf2a01af471c9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不敬，速跪。\\n――面对吾黄金巨匠之霸道，\\n虔诚顺服为宜",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7f44389d84ed456ea62a35da9ad8e2eeec1e4e349395bcd3af15a5a7eba845f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cab077b2231c66ad78dd763",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是都留岐凉花。我的日常工作\\n就是制作各类内容。\\n我会把至高的感动传递给大家",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cdb32d4e05f359abc9bcb9dbaaf4efa5d5b3dacce9033fc609dd44bf0b8ad80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f652268e6a20e1ff0716bfa5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我是高尚骏逸……\\n是的，我自知有些自不量力。不过……\\n总有一天，我会成为――伟、伟大的……没什么，我会加油的",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b95a0c92ed356e04f3ba4bf82f8f430b8eda493a9cdd3e81d963ba3bb6af8a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b64fd045a9e41c8c4ea7ffb1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "新宇宙我，\\n向你提出友好的“接触”方案。\\n换言之――『请多指教』",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bf4e0391b047cfa89bf2b61584d533e8ccb48e7ded9c2e73db8c6e34cd9290d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8135cace00b6c3fbea55dc8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好，我是菱钻奇宝。说不出理由，不过我\\n感觉不错，如果能尽力就更好了呢，\\n请多指教～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5b3b1e0059228aa4308f0b3855fff094aac969bf74705b19a6cbaa89de83a0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e465a690c2e7335300c38b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是烈焰快驹哦。\\n好啦好啦，大家别争了。\\n吃点甜食然后努力吧～，大概就这样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d60ce6e662814e2662c6b198ed2a3ee292261cbf70432a4a4cfac4849b4fbc58",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a16f05a4f400743688e89b3c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是理事长秋川弥生！我将尽全力为我校学生\\n以及支援着她们的训练员们提供帮助！\\n诸位就尽情交给我吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01359ac72e3cd8d81a677285030e5320774938012bfa4f3b7786a82ca1a320ca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09c596d431486f2b970bc674",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是希望之城ー！\\n比赛的话随时奉陪！我要让你们都叫苦不迭……\\n喂你这家伙！别来摸我啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84bf98e17f5cf1e373e372123f42978fc20acf570c7b4c1dd5e7f4e9f840cd97",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:084c8a0529be7d6b04a96b51",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我在此宣告。『要作为先锋，\\n掀起四天王的旋风！』\\n一起把梦想，越吹越大吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7227a7d78c7b5bad104dcf00e4783074f7be4224ed00f442a651dfb8f43fd3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c31d39e4919ce0710146a43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "过程和理论什么的，全都没有意义。\\n胜者就是正义，不对吗？\\n我贵妇人，会让一切屈服于我的",
      "source_fingerprint": "08c16ffdba4f6330cebf1a2d9369a70ca2b51b41e7ddf369d3feb469f3ade12b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12f62cc9f061d6b0772cac54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是莱茵力量！继承心意，\\n开拓道路，连接未来。\\n我想要成为这样的后冠赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f433e0a7856710be3253311048037c7bd54d650919d612e431aab4a57ac506a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:124cd3e794a44ce162b7c6a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的夙愿，是加冕后冠，\\n令其成为我光辉未来的基石。\\n――还请你多多指教哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "16c0a15d855528a6d21ea77aa8ff81b02998392a2ef09a53ce463df465a5741a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94b64cc923870d4be4ea93d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是防爆装束！\\n人类都好温柔，我最最最喜欢人类了！\\n想多多亲近，和大家打成一片！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15983c213bd25b448e5113529dcc288f9bbe99f9fc98cf5a6614b9c8fd890377",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f5b5bb4bce3c799ed75c5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "噫哈哈，吾名为莫名其妙！\\n为了一统天下，吾将不择手段。\\n现在就下克上吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f24d068457caa55aabf2e93730643ded3c68ed1991f8f40e683641c834d46fd6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:998a7aa7901bda257c17254c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是迷人景致。我的梦想，就是兑现约定。\\n――我要抵达那“绝景”。\\n请多关照，训练员！……呵呵",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9e5a740041e088c03b4b5b935359a6c80fda8a2348e59f0f2fbe39b417241db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89cf50c196b86a16b3f4a6b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是远征计划，就交给我梦之旅吧——\\n我会为你准备一段宛如梦境的旅程。\\n因为，你值得那样的旅途",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f12166007f63ec1b58611e776937907b6f7eba7f0d99009bf2603bae5369f40",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:266fbc895b65c1623d251b7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是谋勇兼备。为了养育我、既严厉又温柔\\n的故乡……我要做的梦，很大。\\n那就是“成为被载入史册的赛马娘”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50ac0bf57a1207eafb26643c1d8cc764f500db49b31465e14eb89969d293ad91",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a27ce7878b396a66dbcf699",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Follow my lead!　尽管期待我吧。\\n三后冠的光辉终将降临在我身上。\\n那位未来的女王・勇敢之心身上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb1ee321e6cd1dd2d46f5b295bd95ae0d2f971df8d1ae2ef172c19f41b623d48",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:436b4412dc9b8d74968dee70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是杏目。就算对手\\n是传奇，我也要赢。因为连别人都不是的\\n我自己，都一直这么相信着！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62debb348f547b5222668117009a722b85562353404fdfdd8e659e9573dd7f17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a25416730b6810f7b6f8559",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我叫旺紫丁。\\n为了成为草地上的花形角色，\\n不管什么试炼都要咬牙撑过去。请多指教",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b702a72388347121934e078afd2d42da6ad4b853f7356504e4aa9864b791db7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6a88c4551a94fb184065a4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好的，放声欢呼在此！\\n不管是7.5浪还是12.5浪，\\n未来的英里女王绝不会败北！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2661bcca44c364837c99ca83ea9c0202b1696a3e49e13ecd1053f3a9621d3ece",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:886c9eabcdcc85814ddf371c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就这么着啦，以后多关照～小训♪\\n一起去找那些让人发抖、让人兴奋的事，\\n一块儿嗨起来吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ddce0afd0979124793267903748d1073a4f42ff7be413f55ae5802c4572c690",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10125"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99063212558f1f7e91b704bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我叫机伶金花。喜欢的事，\\n是把花儿打扮得漂漂亮亮。还有嘛……\\n争吵这种事——有点，不太擅长呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "3363e95b11c705e3745c7aba630e24ef51024ab3a86d3d9ff19dcb24bd22f85d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdfb5b055675133cd00e6665",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的目标是像母亲那样强大而华美的……\\n赛马娘。空中救世主——承袭之物的伟大、\\n与相连未来的可贵，我会亲自证实",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2645b25276399fd2d3ee8a27a331457ae700fc13268ef7d95c5f7ceb487ec1d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f704c6057653bd51ad482d37",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字是塔可布莱恩！为了让各位赛马娘\\n能够更进一步，我启动了无人岛项目！\\n来吧，释放你的本能吧——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78e2a602b36f749aff8573eaabb08d2f8b72843bbeb36f575c0767a284f20332",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10128"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88f74d9c091a6acf0196daa5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是房一潘多拉酱～♡  \\n我真的超级天才，完全不用操心哦♡  \\n所～以～，那种根性训练什么的就免了吧♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "a845030dd62fd1b439cf77134a96b6f8e6a11099eea9497d6040e5b1a84bc88b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d99e71b1b800da480295a8a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是凯旋芭蕾。想要当上主角……\\n想站在C位就只能拼命努力！\\n身边全是强者，但我绝不会气馁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93415c7adc113a0137e023eeff608068273ae3d3bd57a20d9b5b0d8da30b6ef0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a327aaa343f3101f15444d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "多多指教，黄金旅程。\\n来吧，让这趟旅程变得有趣些！\\n在黄金之路上，悠然自得地前行吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd13100b68fc78502ac595ed2de59e9782b18987ed1f8f0fa087bb5e3f3458de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d45657beb3cea834dae87ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是爱慕律动。\\n温柔和甜蜜，对我来说都不需要。\\n我只想不断打磨自我……仅此而已",
      "source_fingerprint": "51fe9efaba7407d0b5e09a38169dc8db413c0381d54427d6d8b27d76c0e9a894",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0921a40c88dabe671a21cfd5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是创世驹。很喜欢\\n钻研赛事的历史……也希望能刻下\\n属于自己的蹄迹",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b46db33c6c790fd6bade644c30ac2f694661fda0a80f3a98edb7facf3a4ae9f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd6093eb37f0154154187bdd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "金镇之光。\\n梦想是刷新最高时速。最爱直线。\\n介绍完毕，自我介绍也要最速",
      "source_fingerprint": "808584f9d8937a422a5d14024d77fa73b8c682d0b78beb506f7c4b1379b7c923",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e130261572caf96c0f870b7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吾之圣剑化作奔腾的光辉，\\n为你斩尽一切加诸身上的黑暗！\\n我乃多旺达，誓约与忠义的骑士！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0657edc64d2e37bb52d9acce0b7a82deb01bf4e5fc8719d72e9f558e56cef251",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e8e4f990391015fb08cc246",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在下樱花千岁王。……哎呀，您的脸色？\\n若不介意，不妨从饮食入手如何。\\n调和气血津液，才是日常活力之源",
      "source_fingerprint": "2017aaa88426cdc29cc472385e8ddf0da708f18a1f7cce8d2116e16d54165162",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:664605ad9bf252cbaef92480",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是汤驹旅馆的女将，保科健子。\\n消除疲劳与伤痛，还得靠温泉才对。\\n没错，健康第一……啊不，呵呵呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26d5b9b05560aaf1044eba6fcf6fd8e4ef7efb65123b458db0eb4dfa41420c9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9548bd313a9d6fd37252a1e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈！本官名为超常骏骥，所属\\n中央特雷森学园！为了成为孩子们\\n的榜样，本官将粉身碎骨在所不辞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2cf207b7004623f3e0e037f39c127665975ef9ee24ac90664c6ee430aab1e6e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10139"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f86f38193f56e85bd5b8c16a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Hi!　我是青春永驻！\\nRoadmap都准备好了！\\n在赛马娘界，不搞点创新怎么行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f34424a05954f2320b5eca631faaf11f2464d3616a99c8f0db49cc58fb23ea2c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10140"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:707f49026fbef37d8d0b7476",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是赌场驱动。再高的山巅，\\n只要迈步就能离终点更近。期待你\\n勇敢的一笔投资哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f7ace4b2373ebf33e5fc76e490b9b577ba226fef53d9e9808ea4785a034e132",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3746036298d8add082b09070",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吾名红色梦想。\\n前路必将布满试炼，\\n但我会一一跨越，成为真正的圣女！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92e7d65ea3a660e01ec1045b2de09fac78048ca2bd2fc2de3fa1418e200ac932",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10142"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a30cfbcc6ace0642521f359",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我叫比萨胜驹。\\n为了让“孤身一人”不再存在，\\n我想用希望的光环将世界相连。\\n靠我的奔跑，",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cf0715e34dbda2adc343d265c7aa0b88f69275acba3583c860b1cac34a3efbf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10143"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49f59dcd3ceb33147f3fb5c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那、那个…就是——『你好☆\\n洛林酱登场♪要和青梅竹马的唯爱酱\\n一起，加油干到底☆』",
      "source_fingerprint": "2205c5533eeae47a9416c048431678d4185cba9f64ac1bd69f4712340085da37",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:378127c6eda8a4ba71ee55e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是神业！艰苦的修行、炽热的友情、\\n戏剧性的胜利！在这样的比赛\\n世界里，我一定要成为主人公给大家看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a748c79026bc2e864fe770f1af0c88a4d6b0ae30dba2d158b3e62a49b6e96b8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e467db64f151edfbd50b700b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "——我是乐透心。\\n无论面对怎样的比赛，我都必定取胜。\\n若这便是我理应遵从的命运",
      "source_fingerprint": "c957210779a1558c973d9cf97fcdbd70da41c5f83600bbd41343118c5899d2e2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10146"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:679f8c79197a41f6b13e2c27",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是统治地位。就凭我这完美的\\n战略，将闪耀系列赛这个棋局\\n华丽地支配给你看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3476c03500e5e5ba883cf4e4820a240f9c74b5661078fbe1eb1232ecaac97fd2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10147"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d904d916020900af29ea8c4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是大森逊！\\n不管什么都要去挑战，\\n要成为名震世界的大人物赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcc8238ce208d4f45fdc53168c323f5eb152abdd8d2e376135fb6e67431229bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10148"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec597e2fb791a19995b2919a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "彷佛追着太阳奔跑，一直奔驰到日落。\\n那就是特雷森学园学生的青春。\\n\\n「那么，大概是这样吧。」\\n\\n如此喃喃自语的她，看向眼前的\\n运动饮料以及几个盐味饭团。\\n这样还少的就是……\\n\\n「呼啊、呼啊……小特，快一点。」\\n\\n「铃、铃鹿……我已经、跑不动了～」\\n\\n「呵呵，抵达了啊。这样就到齐了。」\\n\\n瞥向已超过门禁时间的时钟指针，\\n她往宿舍的玄关走去。\\n首先要好好告诫她们必须严守门禁……\\n然后再好好慰劳她们的努力。\\n\\n这就是属于这特雷森学园宿舍长的青春。",
      "source_fingerprint": "907eabba63960c5521fad82e80c05e4a42d032c50502af7b8c0ec9655fc20b47",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f2d7c528f43cad787dc5e32",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「这里要用这个公式……」\\n\\n似乎都没察觉到自己脱口而出的自言自语。\\n旁边放着翻烂的参考书，\\n不断动笔书写的笔记本上\\n记满了井然有序的公式。\\n不经意地，\\n我回忆起她曾这样提过她的母亲。\\n\\n「妈妈是个做什么都很优秀的赛马娘。\\n是我崇拜的对象。」\\n\\n如此说过的她，\\n现在像是要追上母亲般默默地奋笔疾书。\\n看着她这么拼命努力的样子，\\n我不想打扰她，便选择默默离开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a574dfc1c48ccccb75e39f69b4f7d4fcc1b6c0d7594923128d59748f5f0ab5b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9b86149efe750ac3215bfca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "万里无云的晴空之下。\\n大家都在呼喊她的名字，赞扬那份胜利。\\n\\n「哈哈，感觉真棒。\\n……仔──细看好了！\\n我在下场竞赛也会全力以赴！」\\n\\n眼前是轰然巨响的欢呼声。\\n然而，她的思绪却飘向了远方。\\n注视着那个跑在前方的怪物──",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaa0e1c7c55d1c292afeb66c2e782f058b6cac00144d72c5d33407af217226b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:484ef8216ff97bacaa90641c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「接下来只剩下这个装饰。\\n……所有人都有鼓起干劲！」\\n\\n粉丝感谢祭的准备非常顺利！\\n这是当然的──因为一切的一切，\\n都由号称女帝的她进行指挥。\\n\\n「咦，『阿船特制炒面贩卖会』？\\n……是这样的横幅吗？」\\n\\n「啊……？」\\n\\n距离女帝的怒雷劈向犯人赛马娘，\\n还有3秒──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdb46218918d6a9fe20aaa7acc8c8be4b7be93dbccba50254ebfb57e1254f924",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37417be74cda31cdbb04d5b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TSUI☆GEKI　TSUI☆GEKI\\n( ﾟ∀ﾟ)o彡゜( ﾟ∀ﾟ)o彡゜\\n\\nU☆游击注意注意！（什么什么？）\\nM☆弹匣发射一空！（HOO、HOO──！）\\nA☆发动袭击♪（KO～！）\\n\\nTSUI☆GEKI　TSUI☆GEKI\\n( ﾟ∀ﾟ)o彡゜( ﾟ∀ﾟ)o彡゜\\n\\n\\n「FOOOO！萌萌喵很可爱喔～！\\n……唔！？咦、这、等、眼、对──」\\n\\n\\n※还请稍待※\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n「……呼──在千钧一发回神了──\\n竟然在LIVE中灵魂出窍，实在太不小心……\\n……好！得重振精神咯──！」\\n\\n\\n※回到一开始×∞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8214cd2fb3c145d303b2cac6ebe3dde4572850dd30da1832f6cbe51d46410c3c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47e0bed5bf8782f8cee9a4b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「呼……虽然完成了每天的例行项目，\\n但双脚的感觉──应该还可以继续。\\n\\n就计算上的活动极限还有……嗯。\\n腿部推举450公斤做12下的程度啊。\\n……这样的话──」\\n\\n眼镜闪耀出光芒，\\n镜片下的金眸静静燃起火焰。\\n\\n「只剩下验证了……对吧！」\\n\\n干劲十足的她露出认真神情。\\n尾巴也看似愉悦不已地摇摆着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17ec674a918e88dbe42b19df01a0285574ead4480f79865339e030620de7315b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4656059d813b08cbda48d3b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "闪闪发亮的大晴天！\\n\\n「适合进行成熟少女对谈的好日子☆」\\n\\n搭配有点苦味的便利店点心，\\n加上刊登着全新彩妆的时尚杂志♪\\n\\n「啊，上面说白羊座的爱情运势最棒哦☆」\\n\\n「小曙！还有美容甜点特辑呢♪」\\n\\n「呀──！全都不能错过啊！」\\n\\n总是充满欢笑声的少女对谈！\\n当然也做好了防晒工作☆\\n因为这就是大人的嗜好♪\\n少女们的聊天还会持续下去。\\n\\n──要小心别漏听上课铃声！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40ec4d51c2494934923de0609dd23596938e9e0c58473010ed0a30c328c8c5bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0349380bbe3d8a072cf3d785",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "\\n……，…………？\\n\\n「……嗯，没错。\\n……所以我画了……喜欢的图案。」\\n\\n……，…………\\n……，…………，……？\\n\\n「呵呵……猜错了……正确答案是……云……」\\n\\n\\n这就是她在雨天和「朋友」说的悄悄话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65cae361dfccac18afa76cb27b788427dcb73bf49c3383c83272d799833ecbd5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb6ae492de26d021c81aac4f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": ".COMMAND；Squat\\n\\nSTART：0830……\\n　WGT　100㎏+20㎏\\n　SET　10×3\\n……END：\\n\\n──笔尖滑过笔记上方停顿下来。\\n\\n「哈啊……哈啊……确认到出汗、体温上升。\\n但是对下肢的负担还不足。\\n再来一组……加油，喔──」\\n\\n在心中所浮现的好友鼓舞声中，\\n她合上了笔记本。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e06a23c0428d51e47087c6f9c92009d5792195a1758d6d4f3f5cb4706436925",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9592bd84e6049e7b996f3cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "──哔哔！\\n宣告得分的哨声响起。\\n球场上的主角获得胜利。\\n\\n「谢谢！大家都表现得很棒！\\n那份声援鼓舞了我的肌肉哦！」\\n\\n闪亮动人的是太阳，\\n还是她的笑容呢？\\n\\n她出手征服的是篮框，\\n还是观众的心呢？\\n\\n所有问题的答案，都是肯定的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fb89df77f0b1377a38fed0f28f55bb6641f94dd02bbdfecb19366484ce383fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c0b8f0f071705dfc97e7ed4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「请、请快看！上面写了Thank you！\\n还有笑脸图案……太可爱了！」\\n\\n「呵呵，小雪也不会输哦。笑脸。」\\n\\n憧憬的新潮咖啡厅。\\n为了成为都市女孩，\\n而踏入的崭新世界──让少女散发光辉。\\n\\n「好、好了！接下来就是上传到SNS……」\\n\\n「啊，你有在用SNS啊。\\n……诶，可以关注你吗？难得有这个机会。」\\n\\n「哦！？当当当、当然可以了！」",
      "source_fingerprint": "45d5e29750a0451610e802992792bac835b3f364b4782d2789b3a502b366230c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:993433cce931e78dab39657a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "20XX.XX.XX\\n某个爱好研究的赛马娘独白。\\n\\n「我正感到渴望。\\n兴奋到会震动突触的地步。」\\n\\n某间在校舍3楼的空教室。\\n被厚重窗帘隔绝外界的阴暗空间\\n──就是所谓的实验室。\\n\\n这都是为了抵达极限的彼方，\\n事象的另一端。\\n\\n「去找足以胜任燃料的豚鼠……\\n问问新药的成果吧。」\\n\\n──为了满足这份永不知足的探究心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1813592eb3c3fbf1e53d1d9eeddd5e835d021eddcc493bc784e1f338543d81e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:335da44cb38111825e82fea8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "──哔。\\n\\n闹钟响了一声便安静了下来。\\n从斜光的角度看来，判断天气与预报相同。\\n\\n「呼……准时起床。用216秒整理头发、\\n310秒换穿运动服……」\\n\\n「呜喵……开始练习安可咯……」\\n\\n……看着那幸福的睡脸露出微笑。\\n距离表定时刻已过了5.2秒。\\n\\n不过──是让人高兴的误差。\\n\\n「闪耀也得练习……\\n偶像口号才行……哦……」\\n\\n「……咦？」",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbba9173af2b81bc13f36a76096cdd159b34d584e8e0d78b786a4e5de0d2c044",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:645f07d69dff237cdfe63284",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「1、2……呼……」\\n\\n远离喧闹的泳池边。\\n不枉费自己努力做了伸展运动，\\n学生们开始陆续做放学的准备。\\n\\n这样总算可以安静游──\\n\\n「好痛──！？脚抽筋了～～！？\\n救我、救我啊！大进～～！！」\\n\\n「～～唔！就──跟──你──说──！\\n要先好好做伸展运动了吧！」\\n\\n少女言行不一地站起身。\\n看来要进入泳池还要好一阵子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ada740e857fa68c4b7312218a955960089965ea58dd09a58bf68a2a5ebb5dac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c702b95c594673221a8563f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "～新・Marvelous计划！！～\\n　　　　　　　制作人：美丽周日\\n\\n【概要】美丽周日制作的基于Marvelous\\n　　　　且为了Marvelous的……计划！！\\n【目标】向世界传递Marvelous的心情\\n【举办期间】现在！立即！立刻开始！！\\n\\n\\n「所以呢☆现在就要开始咯★」\\n\\n写有企划重要事项的企划书四处飘散。\\n但是没空去管这个了。因为──\\n世界正在等待着我……美丽周日！！\\n\\n※之后老老实实整理了散乱的文件。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb879e15ee98e51de9bf298d888aa3e14c7137f64a5413c5fdf9f9ca2c2fe6ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd372798a07e5aacbc5de803",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "太阳从西向东落下！\\n运势从凶转往吉……不，是大吉。\\n不不不！会是更高一层的大大吉！\\n\\n「降临吧！开运必胜Shiraoki大人！」\\n\\n取出的是\\n「特制☆福来Shiraoki大人谕示单」，\\n可别小看这个！就连竞赛运势\\n都能够彻底看透。（制作者经验谈）\\n\\n「竞赛当天……晴、天、偶、尔……」\\n\\n「多、云……之、后……下、雨……\\n咦，这是占卜？……骗人的吧？」",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e7755d3fa0fd430d1ae63092dd15d7d289debd965247efea0e4ffcaee73e896",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78a14374a392063500a9b859",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「幸福要靠自己掌握！」\\n受这句话深深撼动的少女──\\n\\n感到有点后悔！\\n\\n「好、好难受……还有大家的视线也是……\\n呜呜……真的要这样绕校园一圈……？」\\n\\n「没错！一切都是获得幸福的泉源！\\nLet's fight！Let's开运！」\\n\\n「幸福的……Let's fight……\\nLet's、开运……！」\\n\\n只要努力就一定会有回报。因为──\\n\\n幸福其实就近在眼前。\\n一定会有人看见自己的努力……才是！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a063938d3741b5abe5171dfb5e020bee7551e86edfa3904ca86f45a314cdaf0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33a910da5666fe4a52bdfea4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说是崇拜有点太过，\\n说是目标又有点不足。\\n\\n即使如此，还是想要追上。\\n追上她前方的两道身影。\\n\\n\\n「……好，先完成一项。\\n以赖恩的时间为目标。」\\n\\n\\n视线投射在光亮的赛场上。\\n──另一旁，则有其他人对她的侧脸怀抱着憧憬之情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b06071646cac3a3f04f6ed806887aa1efe11feac71c1892f1d41ba77aae874ca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0561e15e85cc9eda8fd64fef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没什么人的游泳池。\\n恣意游水的不是狼，而是一条鱼。\\n\\n「没有比中午的游泳池更棒的好地方。\\n……好，再游一趟作为缓和运动。」\\n\\n对已泡皱的指尖视而不见。\\n但流下额际的水珠可说是她努力的证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5df9a2ee2a28a631d5fe05aca1156af9933d1ffa4ba5c924041ee1cffc940953",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "20019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3da26c0931f5fec3d2ed14c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一流不是一日造成的。\\n一流是闻一知十。\\n一流是专心致志得到第一名。\\n\\n「太厉害了！不光是练习内容，\\n竟然连心得都是一流的……！」\\n\\n「喔──吼吼吼！\\n如果想变得像我一样，\\n这个一流的三守则……\\n每天都要加在一起好好拜读！」\\n\\n「是的！一流加一流加一流，\\n所以就是三流……！」\\n\\n「没错没错！…………给我等一下。」",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f9869b303550d9979e62b165e5580851c04a5099f389b926cf6e20a3e137a17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
